10:39.540 --> 10:40.380
Yeah.

10:40.380 --> 10:42.180
A pretty good piece, about that big.

10:42.180 --> 10:43.620
You're sure you went to Zanesville?

10:43.620 --> 10:44.460
Yeah.

10:44.460 --> 10:46.680
In fact, I went in a machine shop, he and I,

10:46.680 --> 10:49.080
and had a piece sawed off the metal,

10:49.080 --> 10:51.110
