10:51.110 --> 10:54.310
And we gave the other piece back to the person that had it.

10:54.310 --> 10:56.490
And I knew the person,

10:56.490 --> 10:58.550
and he wouldn't give it to anyone in the world,

10:58.550 --> 11:01.430
but he called me and he drives up in his yard

11:01.430 --> 11:04.030
and there's this red piece of glowing,

11:04.030 --> 11:05.630
he sees this thing over his house

11:05.630 --> 11:07.330
